title: '[EPMB] Add configurable reward source and slash destination to signed phase'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "Fixes #12813 by introducing `type RewardSource` (pay rewards from\
    \ a pot account instead of minting) and `type Slash` (route slashed deposits to\
    \ a handler instead of burning) to `pallet-election-provider-multi-block::signed::Config`,\
    \ keeping `TotalIssuance` reconcilable with the DAP emission curve on Asset Hub.\r\
    \n"
crates:
- name: pallet-election-provider-multi-block
  bump: major
